  "summary": "Malicious code in @ethers-js/contracts (npm)",
  "details": "The postinstall hook (scripts/postinstall.js) is a Windows-targeted downloader. On win32 only, it creates a hidden directory under LOCALAPPDATA/TEMP named 'Microsoft/\u003crandom\u003e', downloads a ZIP from hxxps://marxl[.]com/bin/wvt/swat/7aX0ci[.]zip, extracts it with powershell (Expand-Archive), then launches pythonw.exe r.py from the extracted contents as a detached background process and deletes the ZIP. The package name impersonates the ethers.js project.",
